{"unit_id": "tag:0475:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）间的态射（morphism）。\n假设<MATH_0002>为局部有限型（locally of finite type）。开（open）集合（set）\n<MATHSEG_0001>在<MATHSEG_0002>上非分歧（unramified）于<MATHSEG_0003>在<MATHSEG_0004>上非分歧（unramified）于<MATHSEG_0005>\n的构造与任意基变换（base change）交换（commutes）：\n对任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，考虑基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>（由<MATH_0005>得到）以及投影（projection）<MATH_0006>。于是，集合（set）<MATH_0007>（对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>）等于<MATH_0009>。\n若假设<MATH_0010>为局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），则同样的结论也适用于由使<MATH_0011>为G-非分歧（G-unramified）的点（points）组成的开（open）集合（set）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "G-unramified", "target_term": "G-非分歧"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "开头给定的态射的源与靶。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "开头给定的概形间映射。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "对原态射的第一项假设。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "首次出现的集合的拓扑性质。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "非分歧处构成的开集合。"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "数学文字叶中第一次陈述在指定位置的非分歧性。"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "数学文字叶中第二次陈述在指定位置的非分歧性。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "开集合构造所相容的任意换基操作。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "开集合的构造与任意基变换相容。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用来作基变换的任意映射。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "由原态射得到的基变换。"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影", "context": "基变换后给出的投影。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "基变换后的态射所对应的集合。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "用于指明相应集合的基变换后映射。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示", "context": "最后一个条件句对原态射的假设。"}, {"source_term": "G-unramified", "target_term": "G-非分歧", "context": "最后一个开集合的定义性质。"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "组成最后一个开集合的点。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "最后一个集合的拓扑性质。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "最后一个条件句所述的开集合。"}], "notes": []}
